    import_license_info_en: "Strict import licensing regime. Domiciliation bancaire mandatory. Many goods require prior authorization. Import ban on used goods, used clothing, and some luxury items. 51/49% Algerian ownership rule for importers. Pharmaceutical imports through UFAS or authorized pharmacies only.",
