    customs_reality_en: "Very restrictive import environment. All imports taxed from first dollar ($0 de minimis). Bank domiciliation and complex licensing add weeks. Port congestion in Algiers common. Protectionist policies make many imports expensive. Express couriers available but customs processing slow. Arabic/French documentation required.",
