    customs_reality_en: "Improving rapidly. Ethiopian Customs Commission modernizing with electronic systems. Addis Ababa Bole Airport fairly efficient for express shipments. Chronic foreign currency shortage delays commercial imports significantly. Addis-Djibouti railway has improved transit times. Duty-free industrial parks for manufacturers.",
