    clearance_process_en: "Direction Generale des Douanes manages customs using SYDONIA++ (ASYCUDA) system. Toamasina (Tamatave) port is the main entry point handling ~90% of imports. Customs broker required for commercial imports. French documentation required. 4 tariff bands: 0%, 5%, 10%, 20%.",
